WEBVTT

NOTE
This file was generated by Descript <www.descript.com>

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.880
In a short video, I'm going to
demonstrate how you can apply

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.840
some paragraph formatting to a
letter to enhance the appearance.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.930
The example I'm going to use
as a document I've downloaded

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.250
from the vision2learn website.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.520
The first thing I need to do
is I'm going to change the line

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.669
spacing so that the letter is
more evenly spaced over the page.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.460
So once I've highlighted all of
the text, I will then go to the

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:28.620
line spacing icon and select 1.5.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.920
I could try 2, but 1.5 looks about
right for this document and the content.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.820
So once I've selected that, as you can
see that has spread the information

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.370
out over the page more evenly.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:46.980
The second task would be to change the
alignment of the business address, which

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.450
should really be at the right hand side.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:53.580
So again, I will highlight the address,
go back up to the paragraph section,

00:00:54.450 --> 00:01:00.644
select the Align Right tool from the
bar, click on that and that will then

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:02.295
move the address over to the right.

00:01:05.105 --> 00:01:10.115
The next formatting I want to apply
is to this block of text here, which

00:01:10.115 --> 00:01:11.555
I think should be bullet pointed.

00:01:12.425 --> 00:01:16.414
So again, I will highlight the text,
go back up to the paragraph section,

00:01:16.865 --> 00:01:21.725
select the bullet icon and from the
dropdown select a simple bullet point.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:28.610
The very last piece of formatting
that I will apply to the letter

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:30.480
is to add a border to the page.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.420
Again, go back up to the paragraph
section, I will select the border icon

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:39.830
and the drop down beside it and from
the list, select borders and shading.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:45.260
Once the borders and shading box
has come up, I will then select page

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:48.080
border and select a suitable style.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:51.270
For this document, I'm going
to select a double line style.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.960
I need to check here to make sure
that it's being applied to the

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:57.259
whole document and then select OK.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:03.300
As you can see, that now makes the
letter look much more presentable.

